{
  "_comment": [
    "CROSS-PROCESS CONTRACT: the extent-seeded tool defaults.",
    "The app's panels seed CSF ground, DEM and TreeIso parameters from the cloud's",
    "hits-only extent in TypeScript (src/renderer/lib/groundSegmentDefaults.ts,",
    "demDefaults.ts, treeSegmentDefaults.ts); the Python scripting client gets the",
    "same numbers from the backend (backend-api/param_defaults.py, served by",
    "GET /api/cloud/session/{id}/defaults). This file is the written-down truth both",
    "are tested against:",
    "  - src/renderer/lib/parameterDefaults.contract.test.ts  (vitest)",
    "  - backend-api/tests/test_param_defaults.py            (pytest)",
    "args: ground = [horizontalExtentM, verticalReliefM, pointSpacingM|null];",
    "dem/tree = [horizontalExtentM]. expected uses the backend's snake_case request",
    "field names; the vitest side maps them from the TS camelCase results.",
    "Test-only data: neither implementation reads it at runtime."
  ],
